nemy's affliction, repel and release them when graze enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ca6dfc8b30b11c5c1ee47cafe3764e78.poster.avif?t=1768541948\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ca6dfc8b30b11c5c1ee47cafe3764e78.webm?t=1768541948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ca6dfc8b30b11c5c1ee47cafe3764e78.mp4?t=1768541948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ef29d192750789c7180cf7f5a8b5ca12.poster.avif?t=1768541948\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ef29d192750789c7180cf7f5a8b5ca12.webm?t=1768541948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597820/extras/ef29d192750789c7180cf7f5a8b5ca12.mp4?t=1768541948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Demo version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo version have 3+2 boss to challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you still want to challenge after completed those 3 boss/(or you can't),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >press &quot;=&quot; button to activate CHEAT mode, and holding number pad 1~7 to teleport other stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a